          "description": "Off-screen destination. null or omitted writes the active target (the canvas unless a parent redirected it). Caller-owned and stable across frames; never allocated, pooled, resized or destroyed by the pass. May be the source texture, in which case the chain runs through borrowed intermediates and the result is blitted back."
